          "jaccard_threshold": 0.4,
          "note": "Carving principle_train and principle_val out of model_train promotes model_train's INTERNAL near-duplicate clusters into cross-split pairs, which the contamination guard then fails on (it did, on the ChinaRealEstate/Leju Content License cluster at containment 0.989). So before carving, the 364-contract pool is clustered by 5-gram containment/Jaccard and every contract in a multi-member cluster is bound to model_train \u2014 clusters are indivisible and are assigned wholesale to the Phase-2 pool. Only cluster singletons are eligible for principle_train and principle_val.\nThese thresholds are deliberately STRICTER than contamination_guard's. The guard is a fail condition; this is the preventive rule, and the gap between the two pairs of numbers (0.60 vs 0.80 containment, 0.40 vs 0.60 Jaccard) is exactly the headroom the build retains. Binding at the guard's own thresholds would have left a legal cross-split pair at containment 0.783 against a 0.80 fail line.\n",
